# Vendored cursor packs are published as Windows files and stay byte-for-byte
# what their author shipped: CRLF line endings included. Marked -text so git
# neither normalises them on checkout nor counts every CR as trailing
# whitespace in `git diff --check` -- the builder strips \r itself when it
# reads Installer.inf, and the artwork metadata is not ours to rewrite.
#
# `**` rather than `*` because a pack one level deeper is still the author's:
# assets/third-party/<theme>/cursors/.
assets/**/cursors/*.inf -text
assets/**/cursors/*.txt -text
